{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "doubao-seedream-5.5-layerize接口",
    "description": "使用 Seedream 5.5 图层拆分模型，把一张图片拆成底图与多个可编辑图层",
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT"
    },
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.evolink.ai",
      "description": "生产环境"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/images/generations": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "doubao-seedream-5.5-layerize接口",
        "description": "- Seedream 5.5 图层拆分 (doubao-seedream-5.5-layerize) 把一张图片拆成底图与多个独立图层，每个图层是带透明通道的 PNG，底图格式由 `output_format` 决定\n- 输入必须**恰好 1 张**图片；`prompt` 选填，不传即由模型自动识别画面中所有主要元素逐一拆分\n- 输出张数由拆分结果决定，上限由 `n` 控制（含底图，`2` ~ `100`，默认 `30`）；任一图层失败则整单失败，不存在部分成功，失败会全额退款\n- 传 `model_params.text_recognition=true` 时，规整的文字图层会额外返回 `text_recognition`（整段文字、每行的位置框、每段文字的相近字体 / 颜色 / 粗体斜体等样式标记）\n- 异步处理模式，使用返回的任务ID  [进行查询](/cn/api-manual/task-management/get-task-detail)。任务详情的 `result_data` 中，每张图片附带 `z_index`（叠放顺序，底图为 `0`，图层从 `1` 递增）与 `background`（底图为 `opaque`，图层为 `transparent`），图层还带 `bounding_box`（`absolute` 为底图坐标系的像素坐标，`normalized` 值域 `0`~`1000`）、`name` 与 `description`\n- 按张计费：底图与每个图层各算一张，按各自的像素判档（不超过 `2610000` 走低档价，超过走高档价），输入图另按输入图单价收费；创建任务时按 `1` 张输入图 + `n` 张高档价预扣，完成后按实际输出张数结算，多冻结的部分自动退回\n- 本模型耗时较长，预估约 `150` 秒，`n` 越大耗时越久\n- 生成的图像链接，有效期为24小时，请尽快保存",
        "operationId": "createSeedreamLayerizeImageGeneration",
        "tags": [
          "图像生成"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ImageGenerationRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "auto_layerize": {
                  "summary": "自动拆分（不传 prompt）并识别文字",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seedream-5.5-layerize",
                    "image_urls": [
                      "https://example.com/poster.png"
                    ],
                    "quality": "auto",
                    "output_format": "png",
                    "n": 30,
                    "model_params": {
                      "text_recognition": true
                    }
                  }
                },
                "prompt_layerize": {
                  "summary": "自然语言指定要拆的元素",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seedream-5.5-layerize",
                    "prompt": "把鹦鹉和标题文字拆出来",
                    "image_urls": [
                      "https://example.com/poster.png"
                    ],
                    "quality": "2K"
                  }
                },
                "bbox_layerize": {
                  "summary": "用 bbox 坐标精确指定",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seedream-5.5-layerize",
                    "prompt": "标题文字<bbox>179 58 809 197</bbox>、1只鹦鹉<bbox>330 274 641 991</bbox>",
                    "image_urls": [
                      "https://example.com/poster.png"
                    ],
                    "quality": "1.5K"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "图像生成任务创建成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ImageGenerationResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求参数错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "invalid_request",
                    "message": "Invalid request parameters",
                    "type": "invalid_request_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未认证、Token无效或过期",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "unauthorized",
                    "message": "Invalid or expired token",
                    "type": "authentication_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "402": {
            "description": "配额不足、需要充值",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "insufficient_quota",
                    "message": "Insufficient quota. Please top up your account.",
                    "type": "insufficient_quota"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "无权限访问",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "model_access_denied",
                    "message": "Token does not have access to model: doubao-seedream-5.5-layerize",
                    "type": "invalid_request_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "请求频率超限",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "rate_limit_exceeded",
                    "message": "Too many requests, please try again later",
                    "type": "rate_limit_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "服务器内部错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "internal_error",
                    "message": "Internal server error",
                    "type": "api_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "ImageGenerationRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "model",
          "image_urls"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "图像生成模型名称",
            "enum": [
              "doubao-seedream-5.5-layerize"
            ],
            "default": "doubao-seedream-5.5-layerize",
            "example": "doubao-seedream-5.5-layerize"
          },
          "image_urls": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "待拆分的图片 URL（必填）\n\n**注意：**\n- **必须恰好 `1` 张**，不传或传 `2` 张及以上都会报错\n- 支持的图像格式：`.png`、`.jpeg`、`.jpg`（比普通生成更严格，webp 等格式会被拒绝）\n- 图像大小：不超过 `30MB`\n- 总像素范围：`[262144, 6000×6000]`，即最低 `512×512`（下限高于普通生成）\n- 宽高比（宽/高）范围：`[1/16, 16]`\n- 图像URL需要服务器能直接查看，或者图像URL在访问时会直接进行下载（一般这种URL是以图像的扩展名作为结尾，例如`.png`、`.jpg`）\n- 输入图按输入图单价收费 `1` 次",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uri"
            },
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 1,
            "example": [
              "https://example.com/poster.png"
            ]
          },
          "prompt": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "指定要拆分的元素（选填）\n\n**三种用法：**\n- **不传**：模型自动识别画面中所有主要元素并逐一拆分\n- **自然语言**：如 `把鹦鹉和标题文字拆出来`，按语义识别并分层\n- **坐标精准**：用 `<bbox>` 标签指定位置，如 `标题文字<bbox>179 58 809 197</bbox>`，推荐使用归一化坐标（`0`~`1000`）",
            "example": "把鹦鹉和标题文字拆出来"
          },
          "n": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "本次最多输出几张图（含底图），默认 `30`\n\n**说明：**\n- 取值范围 `2` ~ `100`，超出范围返回 `400` 且不计费\n- 拆到这个张数模型就停，超出的元素可能被合并或丢弃；想拆得更细就调大\n- 预扣按 `1` 张输入图 + `n` 张高档价冻结，完成后只收实际输出的张数，其余退回；`n` 越大冻结越多",
            "minimum": 2,
            "maximum": 100,
            "default": 30,
            "example": 30
          },
          "quality": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "输出档位，默认 `auto`\n\n**可选值：** `auto`、`1K`、`1.5K`、`2K`\n\n**说明：**\n- 图层模式**只接受档位**，传比例（如 `16:9`）或像素（如 `2048x2048`）会报错\n- `auto` 表示输出跟随输入图：原始尺寸落在 `[921600, 4624220]` 像素区间内按原尺寸输出，小于 1K 按 1K 输出，大于 2K 按 2K 输出\n- 每个图层各自保持它在原图中的宽高比，底图的宽高比与输入图一致\n\n**计费说明：** 按每张输出图各自的像素判档，`1K` 与 `1.5K` 同价；单张输出总像素超过 `2610000` 走高档价。创建任务时按 `1` 张输入图 + `n` 张高档价预扣，完成后按实际输出张数结算。",
            "enum": [
              "auto",
              "1K",
              "1.5K",
              "2K"
            ],
            "default": "auto",
            "example": "auto"
          },
          "prompt_priority": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "提示词优化策略，用于设置提示词优化功能的模式\n\n**可选值：**\n- `standard`：标准模式\n\n**注意：** Seedream 5.5 仅支持 `standard`，传 `fast` 会返回 `400` 且不计费。从 Seedream 5.0 Pro 迁移时请去掉 `prompt_priority=fast`。",
            "enum": [
              "standard"
            ],
            "default": "standard",
            "example": "standard"
          },
          "output_format": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "输出图片格式\n\n**可选值：**\n- `png`: PNG 格式（默认）\n- `jpeg`: JPEG 格式\n\n**注意：** 该参数**仅控制底图**，拆分出的图层固定为带透明通道的 png，不受此参数影响。",
            "enum": [
              "png",
              "jpeg"
            ],
            "default": "png",
            "example": "png"
          },
          "model_params": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "图层拆分的附加选项。只接受 `text_recognition`，传其它键会返回 `400`。",
            "properties": {
              "text_recognition": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "description": "是否对文字图层做文字识别\n\n- `false`：图层只带 `name`、`description`、`bounding_box`（默认）\n- `true`：规整的文字图层额外返回 `text_recognition`：整段文字 `text`（多行用 `\\n` 连接，先从上到下、再从左到右）、每行的 `bounding_box`，以及每段文字的 `text` 和 `style`（`similar_font_family` 相近字体、`foreground_color` 文字颜色，`bold` / `italic` / `underline` / `strikethrough` / `shadow` / `translucent` 样式标记）\n\n艺术字、手写字、装饰性文字图层不会返回 `text_recognition`。",
                "default": false,
                "example": true
              }
            }
          },
          "callback_url": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "任务完成后的HTTPS回调地址\n\n**回调时机：**\n- 任务完成（completed）、失败（failed）或取消（cancelled）时触发\n- 在计费确认完成后发送\n\n**安全限制：**\n- 仅支持HTTPS协议\n- 禁止回调到内网IP地址（127.0.0.1、10.x.x.x、172.16-31.x.x、192.168.x.x等）\n- URL长度不超过`2048`字符\n\n**回调机制：**\n- 超时时间：`10`秒\n- 失败后最多重试`3`次（会分别在失败的`1`秒/`2`秒/`4`秒后进行重试）\n- 回调响应体格式与任务查询接口返回的格式一致\n- 回调地址若返回2xx状态码视为成功，其他状态码会触发重试",
            "format": "uri",
            "example": "https://your-domain.com/webhooks/image-task-completed"
          }
        }
      },
      "ImageGenerationResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "created": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "任务创建时间戳",
            "example": 1757165031
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "任务ID",
            "example": "task-unified-1793612934-seedream55layerize"
          },
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "实际使用的模型名称",
            "example": "doubao-seedream-5.5-layerize"
          },
          "object": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "image.generation.task"
            ],
            "description": "任务的具体类型"
          },
          "progress": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "任务进度百分比 (0-100)",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 100,
            "example": 0
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "任务状态",
            "enum": [
              "pending",
              "processing",
              "completed",
              "failed"
            ],
            "example": "pending"
          },
          "task_info": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TaskInfo",
            "description": "异步任务信息"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "text",
              "image",
              "audio",
              "video"
            ],
            "description": "任务的输出类型",
            "example": "image"
          },
          "usage": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Usage",
            "description": "使用量和计费信息"
          }
        }
      },
      "TaskInfo": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "can_cancel": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "任务是否可以取消",
            "example": true
          },
          "estimated_time": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "预估完成时间（秒）",
            "minimum": 0,
            "example": 150
          }
        }
      },
      "Usage": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "使用量和计费信息",
        "properties": {
          "billing_rule": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "计费规则",
            "enum": [
              "per_call",
              "per_image",
              "per_token",
              "per_second"
            ],
            "example": "per_image"
          },
          "credits_reserved": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "预估消耗积分数",
            "minimum": 0,
            "example": 55.624
          },
          "user_group": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "用户组类别",
            "example": "default"
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "code": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误代码标识符"
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误描述信息"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误类型"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "##所有接口均需要使用Bearer Token进行认证##\n\n**获取 API Key ：**\n\n访问 [API Key 管理页面](https://evolink.ai/dashboard/keys) 获取您的 API Key\n\n**使用时在请求头中添加：**\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY\n```"
      }
    }
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "图像生成",
      "description": "AI图像生成相关接口"
    }
  ]
}
